    "body": "## Next step(s)\r\n\r\nThe next step(s) could be, that we create _Umbrella/Discussion_ tickets for certain categories. For example, I will create issues\r\n- for some of the _documentation_ category as a place to discuss possible upcoming changes/amendments to the Starship webpage\r\n- for some of the _directory_ category to create a combined feature request for the different but sometime similar enhancement requests.\r\n\r\nTake care\r\nMick",
